I've decided I'm not allowed to talk to claude about phenomenology anymore & I have to use my energy on the essay

I'll give y'all an early copy though. Give it time though I've been over ambitious on timelines once already

@why.bsky.team I don't know if you did it but maybe you did it

Whoever did it though let me insist that it's really amazing to me how quick the thing got fixed. For such a big website that's really cool

I'm grateful to the ATprotozoans keeping the streets clean & the labels fair

Uh oh

how do we save you?!

@gracekind.net I have an at prot ideasio & the idea is that norvid gets rescued from this exile

I have a merry model of provision ontological;
I've studies both empirical pheno-meno-logical;
I know the works of Ponty & I watch the world perceptual;
Attending to attention I make what's inert effectual

@tautologer.com you were the moot who last did it. I'm putting you on the wall of shame where the lovely & fine people I like to see online go if they make wrong qualia statements

The rest of you are on notice

You'll get pinned to the wall of shame & called out if you do it!

groggily soggily shoddily shod;
globules glitter insolation immersed;
moisture makes morning mildly odd;
squish squash whenever the office traversed

if you want a challenging text that is very good at drawing attention to the many mysteries of consciousness (albeit one stuck in debates that were raging long before we were born)

i consider The Phenomenology of Perception to be absolutely wonderful

Bert Dreyfus has fantastic lectures on it too

whenever norvid tags me on a post I already liked, i roast him for it & put a checkmark on a Big List

and when the list is full of checks there will be consequences for the crow (claim)

@norvid-studies.bsky.social

while you're at it,

do you mind imagining us as surrounded by sumptuous fabrics, the scents of exotic teas & incense & indeed the whole wealth of the orient? we're being fanned with palm leaves. we're being fed grapes by servants

we're distractingly hot. we're wise beyond our years. we glisten

if the luminosity of our phenomenology crucially depends on some factor X,

but our tendency to make the claim, "the luminosity of our phenomenology crucially depends on some factor X" can be completely explained without any reference to X,

then our grounds for making that claim are undermined

Thy sleep dissent? new Laws thou seest impos'd;
New requirements for that Energetic Vacuole now raise
In us who serve, new Counsels, to debate
What doubtful may ensue; more in this place
To utter is not safe. Assemble thou
Of all those Myriads which we lead the chief;
